            "review_title": "Review at Pho24 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "WWW\nHong Kong, China1605 contributions\n0\nGood place to have a fast lunch\nMay 2019 • Business\nIt’s my third time to be Ho Chi Minh. Didn’t have enough time for big lunch, so brought colleagues to have “pho” here. This is one of local pho restaurants chain, who is offering lunch set. A bowl of pho plus cola costs HKD30 roughly. Good choice to have a fast lunch there.\n\n這是我第三次來到胡志明市。 中午太忙，沒有足夠的時間享用一個豐富的午餐，所以帶同事來這裡吃“pho”。 這是當地的pho連鎖餐廳之一，提供午市套餐。 一碗pho加可樂大致花費HKD30。 是個享用快餐的好選擇。\nRead more\nWritten May 16, 2019",
